# Animation Development Standards

Follow `docs/components/official-animation-system.md`.

Rules:

- Use CSS/Tailwind transitions for hover, focus, active and simple microinteractions.
- Use Framer Motion for entrance, reveal and declarative stagger.
- Use GSAP ScrollTrigger only for scrub, pinning or complex scroll timelines.
- Never use two engines for the same effect in one component.
- Keep variants in `src/lib/motion.ts`.
- Keep reusable animation wrappers in `src/components/animations/`.
- Import GSAP only through `loadGsapScrollTrigger()` from `src/lib/gsap.ts`.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` and `useReducedMotion`.
- Animate `opacity`, `transform` and `scale`; avoid layout properties.
- Do not turn an entire section into a Client Component just for a small animation.
